OL,3,GNEWSA'Cinderella Service' war dead to
OL,4,Abe honoured
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of airmen and women who lost
OL,7,Ftheir lives during World War Two are to
OL,8,Fbe honoured.
OL,10,FA total of 12,500 names of Coastal
OL,11,FCommand personnel will be added to the
OL,12,FLosses Database at the International
OL,13,FBomber Command Centre in Lincoln on
OL,14,FTuesday 1 September.
OL,16,FAlso known as the Cinderella Service,
OL,17,Fthe aircrew were responsible for
OL,18,Fkeeping Britain's vital sea lanes open
OL,19,Fand safe from German U-boats.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
