OL,3,GNEWSA'Cinderella Service' war dead to
OL,4,Abe honoured
OL,5,
OL,6,FDave Gilbert, the centre's trustee and
OL,7,Flosses archivist, said: "Behind every
OL,8,Fstatistic there are men and women whose
OL,9,Flives were cut tragically short and
OL,10,Ffamilies whose lives were forever
OL,11,Fchanged."
